   },
   {
    "id": 7,
    "account_id": 1,
    "symbol": "NVDA",
    "kind": "note",
    "text": "Plan, 11-17 round: NVDA reported after the 11-17 close (rev $115.8B vs $111.3B est, EPS 2.68 vs 2.53, guide above; board confirms Huang will not return). After-hours 162.94 (+4.8%). I will NOT buy at the 11-17 mid (154.26): that price predates the report, so buying it would trade on information the fill could not have had. Decide at the 11-18 session, at a price that includes the reaction. In favour: P/E ttm 19.7 (0th pct of 5y), forward ~10x FY+1, revenue +106% YoY. Against: CEO ouster / governance, analysts cut buy 49->36 and hold 2->14 in a month, 172 insider sales and no buys in a year. Size: up to ~$1,000 (10%) from cash.",
